  <History Date="13-06-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Created" Version="1" />
  <History Date="23-08-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Created from Terbly OV370Z-R" Version="2" />
  <History Date="28-08-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Created from Elation Platinum Wash ZXF Pro XL" Version="3" />
  <History Date="28-08-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Created from Clay Paky A.leda K20" Version="4" />
  <History Date="30-10-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Edited extended mode to include cell layout. Added RGBW master channels and added attribute links to RGBW cells" Version="5" />
  <History Date="27-10-13" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Increased 16-bit functions to 2dp.  Standardised shutted function order." Version="6" />
  <History Date="27-10-13" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added detailed functions to Colour Macro and Function attributes." Version="7" />
  <History Date="27-10-13" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed shape mode.  Added Extended RGBW mode." Version="8" />
  <History Date="27-10-13" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Clay Paky A.leda Wash K10" Version="9" />
  <History Date="11-02-14" Author="RGB Power on Updater" Comment="Updated RGB Power on values to match Locate." Version="10" />
  <History Date="02-03-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added 'Full' mode and brought in line with latest spec." Version="11" />
  <History Date="08-06-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated Shape strobe, Back strobe and back select to latest spec." Version="12" />
  <History Date="08-06-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated shapes." Version="13" />
  <History Date="08-06-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added shape offset conditional functions for new shapes." Version="14" />
  <History Date="08-06-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised wheel mappings and attribute groups." Version="15" />
  <History Date="08-06-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed lens rot CW spin range.  Changed lens rot spin display to value 1dp to provide full resolution." Version="16" />
  <History Date="02-01-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated to 11.2014 spec" Version="17" />
  <History Date="24-11-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed extended mapping" Version="18" />
  <History Date="01-12-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Clay Paky A.leda B-EYE K10" Version="19" />
  <History Date="23-02-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed BG Select and Colour Macro to default at zero in attempt to fix customer bug report." Version="20" />
  <History Date="23-02-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed shape function range." Version="21" />
  <History Date="15-04-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Color Imagination FLYEYE 1915F" Version="22" />
  <History Date="20-04-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised shutter functions in reponse to customer bug report.  Note values provided in percentage." Version="23" />
  <History Date="11-07-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Unknown LED Beam Wash 15W (very poor documentation)" Version="24" />
  <History Date="04-07-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from TipTop Hawkeye 2" Version="25" />
  <History Date="05-07-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="26" />
  <History Date="06-06-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail.  Changed RGB masters to locate at zero." Version="27" />
  <History Date="06-06-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised shutter ranges in response to Atlabase feedback (customer confirmed.  manufacturer's charts are wrong)" Version="28" />
  <History Date="12-12-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Elcotec LED Big Eye 19 Moving Head" Version="29" />
  <History Date="14-12-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="30" />
  <History Date="14-05-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Unknown LED Moving Head 19pcs 15W 4-in-1 (poor documentation.  pixel layout missing - assumed identical.  conflicting tilt ranges)." Version="31" />
  <History Date="13-07-22" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="32" />
  <History Date="20-07-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Viking Lighting VK1941 Super Vortex (hopeless documentation.  contains range conflics.  identical.  no pixel layout)" Version="33" />
  <History Date="21-07-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="34" />
  <History Date="12-07-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Beyond Lighting IP65 19x40W Bee Eye Moving Head (identical)" Version="35" />
  <History Date="16-07-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Imrelax IM-BEE1940 (effectively identical.  usual clueless documentation.  no pixel layout)" Version="37" />
  <History Date="16-07-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Phocea Light Lyre PRO WASH 19x20W (poor documentation.  no pixel layout)" Version="38" />
  <History Date="18-07-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="39" />
  <History Date="18-07-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed 94 channel mode." Version="40" />
  <History Date="05-08-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Rico B-Eye 1940 IP (no pixel layout.  macro functions not documented properly and don't make sense)" Version="41" />
  <History Date="07-08-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="42" />
  <History Date="07-11-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from BeamZ NEREID1940 (hopeless documentation.  mostly nonsense.  no pixel layout)" Version="43" />
  <History Date="12-11-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="44" />
  <History Date="23-06-25" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Betopper LM1915 (identical.  no pixel layout)" Version="45" />
